<title>RUSSIA: Three die in Moscow-Petersburg train blast -agency.</title>
<headline>Three die in Moscow-Petersburg train blast -agency.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three people were killed and six wounded in an explosion on a train travelling between Moscow and St Petersburg, Interfax news agency quoted emergencies officials as saying on Friday.</p>
<p>The agency gave no other details.</p>
</text>
